**Formula (adding decimals by place value):**
\[
(a+\tfrac{b}{10}+\tfrac{c}{100})+(d+\tfrac{e}{10}+\tfrac{f}{100})
=(a+d)+\tfrac{(b+e)}{10}+\tfrac{(c+f)}{100}
\]

Apply it:
\[
\left(9+\tfrac{5}{10}+\tfrac{7}{100}\right)+\left(2+\tfrac{1}{10}+\tfrac{3}{100}\right)
=(9+2)+\tfrac{(5+1)}{10}+\tfrac{(7+3)}{100}
\]
\[
=11+\tfrac{6}{10}+\tfrac{10}{100}
=11+\tfrac{6}{10}+\tfrac{1}{10}
=11+\tfrac{7}{10}
=\mathbf{11.7}
\]

**Answer: \(\mathbf{11.7}\) (or \(\mathbf{11\frac{7}{10}}\)).**

