\[
\frac{-4}{13}=\frac{-8}{26}
\]

Subtracting a negative is the same as adding:

\[
\frac{-8}{26}-\frac{-3}{26}
=\frac{-8+3}{26}
=\boxed{\mathbf{-\frac{5}{26}}}
\]

